OL,3,ABT agrees rescue deal to buy broadband
OL,4,Aoperator TalkTalk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's biggest broadband provider,
OL,7,FBT, has agreed to rescue rival operator
OL,8,FTalkTalk in a takeover.
OL,10,FThe takeover would end of months of
OL,11,Fspeculation over the future of TalkTalk
OL,12,Fand mean services for its millions of
OL,13,Fcustomers will continue as normal.
OL,15,FSome have raised concerns about the
OL,16,Fincreased control BT will have over the
OL,17,Fbroadband market as a result of the
OL,18,Fdeal.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
