OL,3,ABT agrees rescue deal to buy broadband
OL,4,Aoperator TalkTalk
OL,5,
OL,6,FBT chief executive Alison Kirkby said
OL,7,Fthe deal provided "a safety net" for
OL,8,Fthose who customers rely on TalkTalk.
OL,9,FThe administrator said it also provided
OL,10,Fcertainty for TalkTalk's 900 staff.
